628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (Digital fraud has created a crisis of confidence in business messaging. Customers don't trust text messages from brands. They delete legitimate communications, ignore important notifications, and resist engaging with promotional offers. Businesses lose sales, waste marketing spend, and watch their brand reputations suffer from scammer impersonation.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
629 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (Verified RCS messaging solves the trust problem. Carrier-grade authentication proves message authenticity. Visual verification indicators give customers instant confidence. Scammers cannot impersonate verified brands. Customers learn to trust verified messages and engage with content they previously would have deleted.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
630 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (The business impact is substantial. Verified RCS messages achieve 95%+ open rates versus 15-20% for SMS. Click-through rates improve 3-5x. Conversion rates for promotional campaigns increase 5-7x. Customer service costs related to fraud verification drop 60-80%.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
631 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (This isn't incremental improvement. It's fundamental change in how businesses and customers communicate. For the first time, customers can confidently engage with business messages knowing they're legitimate. Brands can communicate effectively knowing customers will see, trust, and act on their messages.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
632 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (The US market is ready for this transition. Major carriers support RCS. Most Android devices have RCS capability. Automatic SMS fallback ensures universal reach. Implementation timelines are short: 1-2 days for RCS Basic, 2-5 days for RCS Studio.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
